* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# VTank file-compatibility fixtures: real VTank .usd/.ast/.utl profiles and real
# metaf .af/.met/.nav samples whose exact CRLF-vs-LF byte layout is asserted by
# round-trip tests. `-text` disables git's line-ending normalization so a
# checkout on any OS or core.autocrlf setting reproduces the committed bytes.
# The bundled plugin's default profile is the same byte-exact VTank format.
# The automation-session proof's profile inputs are real profiles too, and the
# proof feeds them to the plugin exactly as they sit on disk.
